{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"9a517b50-56a4-4b09-a9ab-6b2ba158aeed","step":{"id":"s1","script":"A butterfly can model mirror symmetry. Draw a vertical line through its body: this will be our line of reflection.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Butterfly mirror symmetry"},{"op":"figure","id":"butterfly","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-2.6,2.6],"y":[-2,2.7],"axes":"none"},"marks":[{"kind":"segment","id":"axis","from":[0,-1.8],"to":[0,2.5],"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"param","id":"body","x":"0.16*cos(t)","y":"0.9*sin(t)","t":[0,6.283185307179586]},{"kind":"circle","center":[0,1.05],"r":0.2},{"kind":"group","mirror":"x","origin":[0,0],"repeat":2,"marks":[{"kind":"polyline","points":[[0.1,1.2],[0.3,1.6],[0.5,1.7]],"smooth":true}]}]},{"op":"text","id":"axis_note","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.1},"content":"Dashed line = mirror line"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"9a517b50-56a4-4b09-a9ab-6b2ba158aeed","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Draw two wings on one side, then reflect them. Each reflected wing has the same shape and size, facing the opposite way.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"wings","on":"butterfly","marks":[{"kind":"group","mirror":"x","origin":[0,0],"repeat":2,"marks":[{"kind":"polyline","points":[[0.16,0.5],[0.8,2],[2,1.5],[1.7,0.5],[0.16,0]],"closed":true,"smooth":true,"fill":true},{"kind":"polyline","points":[[0.16,0],[1.7,0.5],[1.8,-0.7],[0.9,-1.5],[0.16,-0.6]],"closed":true,"smooth":true,"fill":true}]}]},{"op":"text","id":"wing_note","anchor":{"el":"axis_note","side":"below","gap":0.12},"content":"Same shape, same size, flipped"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"9a517b50-56a4-4b09-a9ab-6b2ba158aeed","step":{"id":"s3","script":"Matching points sit at equal distances on opposite sides of the mirror line. Folding along that line would make the wings overlap.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"matching","on":"butterfly","marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"left_tip","at":[-2,1.5],"label":"A"},{"kind":"point","id":"right_tip","at":[2,1.5],"label":"A′"},{"kind":"point","id":"middle","at":[0,1.5]},{"kind":"measure","from":{"at":"left_tip"},"to":{"at":"middle"},"label":"2"},{"kind":"measure","from":{"at":"middle"},"to":{"at":"right_tip"},"label":"2"}]},{"op":"text","id":"distance_note","anchor":{"el":"wing_note","side":"below","gap":0.12},"content":"Matching points: equal distances"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"If a wing tip is 3 units left of the mirror line, where is its matching tip?","expected_gist":"3 units right of the line, at the same height"}}}
